...@../../_tools/theme
direction: right

design_planner: 2. 디자인 플래너 (DesignPlanner) { class: ours }
project_coordinator: 3. 프로젝트 코디네이터 (ProjectCoordinator) { class: ours }
timeline: 일정 도구 (calculate_timeline) { class: ours }
gen_tool: 생성 도구 (generate_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
edit_tool: 편집 도구 (edit_renovation_rendering) { class: ours }
list_tool: 목록 도구 (list_renovation_renderings) { class: ours }

flash: gemini-3-flash-preview { class: ext }

design_planner -> flash: instruction + 도구 선언
design_planner -> timeline: calculate_timeline 호출
project_coordinator -> flash: instruction + 렌더링 도구 선언
project_coordinator -> gen_tool: 호출
project_coordinator -> edit_tool: 호출
project_coordinator -> list_tool: 호출
